*> vybe-test: cobol/data_group_level/data_group_nested_group_and_elementary
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_data_group_level.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 OUTER.
   05 HEADER PIC X(4) VALUE "HEAD".
   05 DETAILS.
      10 D1 PIC 9(2) VALUE 11.
      10 D2 PIC 9(2) VALUE 22.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY HEADER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING HEADER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HEAD"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HEAD] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY D1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING D1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "11"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [11] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY D2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING D2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "22"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [22] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

